import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="AI Automation Services — OmniAI Studio" description="Explore OmniAI Studio services for AI automation, document intelligence, AI agents, workflow orchestration, and custom AI systems." canonical="https://omniaistudio.in/services">
<div class="page"><p class="eyebrow">SERVICES</p><h1 class="display">AI systems designed around the work, not the buzzword.</h1><p class="lead">OmniAI Studio combines automation, AI models, APIs, data, validation, and human review to solve specific operational problems.</p><section class="section"><div class="service-grid"><a class="card service" href="/services/ai-automation"><span>01</span><h2>AI Automation</h2><p>Automate repetitive business processes across forms, CRMs, email, spreadsheets, APIs, and internal systems.</p><b>Explore service ↗</b></a><a class="card service" href="/services/document-ai"><span>02</span><h2>Document AI</h2><p>Extract, classify, validate, and route information from invoices, forms, PDFs, and other documents.</p><b>Explore service ↗</b></a><a class="card service" href="/services/ai-agents"><span>03</span><h2>AI Agents</h2><p>Build task-focused agents that retrieve information, reason over context, and execute defined actions.</p><b>Explore service ↗</b></a><a class="card service" href="/services/custom-ai-systems"><span>04</span><h2>Custom AI Systems</h2><p>Create focused internal tools, assistants, dashboards, and integrations around a particular business requirement.</p><b>Explore service ↗</b></a></div></section><section class="section"><div class="card note"><p class="eyebrow">THE PRINCIPLE</p><h2>Use AI where it creates leverage. Use deterministic software where it creates reliability.</h2><p>Not every step needs an LLM. Good automation separates probabilistic AI tasks from validation, business rules, permissions, and predictable system operations.</p></div></section></div>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.service-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}.service{min-height:300px;position:relative}.service>span{font-size:10px;color:#8de4f4}.service h2{font-size:34px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin-top:70px}.service p{color:#7f899d;line-height:1.7;max-width:520px}.service b{display:block;color:#8de4f4;font-size:12px;margin-top:30px}.note{padding:45px!important}.note h2{font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,48px);letter-spacing:-.05em;max-width:800px}.note p:last-child{color:#7f899d;line-height:1.7;max-width:700px}@media(max-width:650px){.service-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.service h2{margin-top:45px}}</style>
